# Lempi fleet time [GDE-ECHO-300]. Smart is the LAN reference: disciplining
# every node to one server makes its error common-mode, which cancels in the
# node-to-node comparison echo playback depends on.
server 192.168.67.93 iburst prefer minpoll 4 maxpoll 6
# Identical fallback on every node, so a Smart outage degrades the fleet
# together rather than splitting it. Both are non-leap-smearing.
pool us.pool.ntp.org iburst maxsources 3
server time.nist.gov iburst
